stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UPLOADED: Upload Lambda: PutItem (initial metadata)
    UPLOADED --> PROCESSING: Start-Workflow Lambda: UpdateItem, after StartExecution
    PROCESSING --> PROCESSED: Metadata Lambda: saves the merged OCR/Thumbnail/Validation result
    PROCESSING --> FAILED: Metadata Lambda: saveFailure, on any branch Catch (OCR, Thumbnail, Validation, or Merge/Persist)
    PROCESSED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]

    note right of PROCESSING
        DocumentStatus also defines OCR_COMPLETED and VALIDATED
        (per-branch progress), but the current implementation only
        persists the coarse-grained UPLOADED / PROCESSING / PROCESSED
        / FAILED states to DynamoDB; per-branch progress lives in the
        Step Functions execution state, not in the document record.
    end note
